       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-RUNTIME-THEOREMS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RUNTIME-TF-PROOFS.
           05  WS-BFC-ALLOCATOR-NO-FRAG    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EAGER-TRACE-COMPILE-EQ   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TFSERVING-GRPC-BOUND     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TFX-METADATA-MERKLE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REMOTECALL-SCSI-IMMUNITY PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-RUNTIME-TF-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-RUNTIME-TF-PROVEN    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-RUNTIME-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MEMORY-AND-EXECUTION.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SERVING-AND-METADATA.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-RPC-SAFETY.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-RUNTIME-THEOREMS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MEMORY-AND-EXECUTION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BFC-ALLOCATOR-NO-FRAG.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EAGER-TRACE-COMPILE-EQ.
       2000-EVALUATE-SERVING-AND-METADATA.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TFSERVING-GRPC-BOUND.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TFX-METADATA-MERKLE.
       3000-EVALUATE-RPC-SAFETY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REMOTECALL-SCSI-IMMUNITY.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-RUNTIME-THEOREMS.
           IF WS-BFC-ALLOCATOR-NO-FRAG = 1 AND
              WS-EAGER-TRACE-COMPILE-EQ = 1 AND
              WS-TFSERVING-GRPC-BOUND = 1 AND
              WS-TFX-METADATA-MERKLE = 1 AND
              WS-REMOTECALL-SCSI-IMMUNITY = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-RUNTIME-TF-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-RUNTIME-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-RUNTIME-TF-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-RUNTIME-CODE.
